https://go.documentation.sas.com/?docsetId=calcontexts&docsetTarget=n1hjn8eobk5pyhn1wg3ja0drdl6h.htm&docsetVersion=3.5&locale=en
  @param [in] mdebug=(0) set to 1 to enable DEBUG messages

