/*** HELP START ***//*

The `prince()` function asks to draw a sheep...

---

### Arguments: ############################

The function has no arguments.

### Dependencies: #########################

The `prince()` function requires 
the `rose.` format to work.

### Example: ##############################

Ask for a sheep:
~~~~~~~~~~sas
data _null_;
  s=prince();
  put s=;
run;
~~~~~~~~~~

---

*//*** HELP END ***/

function prince() $ 42;
  file log;

  length i $ 256;
  r=rand('integer',1,4);
  i = put(r, rose.);
